Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.84,0:00:09.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}1234 5678
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.75,0:00:12.79,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}2234 ...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.64,0:00:12.35,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.02,0:00:15.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好的！這才開始呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.18,0:00:23.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,1234 5678
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.49,0:00:25.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs50}《詳解 保育員資格考試題庫》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.93,0:00:25.02,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.74,0:00:26.62,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.57,0:00:30.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.59,0:00:34.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們翻越了堆積如山的工作 終於能休假了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.59,0:00:37.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！好像快點見到你！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.97,0:00:42.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我那軟綿綿的 像棉花糖一樣的白雲 真白啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.93,0:00:45.94,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 別再說了 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.20,0:00:49.17,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我都說過了 已經不是小孩子了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.44,0:00:53.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 是啊 抱歉抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.49,0:00:57.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 不管你長多大 永遠都是我可愛的女兒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.86,0:01:00.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 好想快點見到你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.61,0:01:03.82,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.09,0:01:05.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（拉炮聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.37,0:01:06.71,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,恭喜你！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.17,0:01:09.77,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你喜悅的聲音 我們在外面都聽到了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.93,0:01:11.14,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,聽到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.32,0:01:12.99,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是... 是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.16,0:01:15.73,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,令尊令母 什麼時候回來？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.26,0:01:20.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,後天 我準備去桃空機場去接他們
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.22,0:01:23.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,機場？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.40,0:01:28.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 就是上次送遇到麻煩的阿婆去的那個地方！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.45,0:01:30.38,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.65,0:01:31.91,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,機場啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.38,0:01:34.44,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我早想去一次了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.69,0:01:37.76,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是能夠看到飛機起飛的地方！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.23,0:01:41.89,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我還記得桃空機場的餐飲區
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.08,0:01:44.34,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,有燒鯛魚... 啊 不對
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.55,0:01:46.31,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是有鯛魚燒店的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.86,0:01:50.53,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 而且還是飛機造型的鯛魚燒哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.69,0:01:51.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.77,0:01:53.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那就一定要去吃一次了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.02,0:01:58.39,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼坐我的車 大伙一起去機場？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.10,0:02:04.60,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,還能給小白的爸爸媽媽一個驚喜 怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.99,0:02:06.03,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好的！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.20,0:02:08.45,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,去機場！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.11,0:03:47.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}起飛！由飛機相繫的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.57,0:03:49.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\frz356.6\pos(396,561)}{\3a&HFF&\4c&H9367B4&}桃空機場
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.38,0:03:57.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乘客們 久等了 將於10點35分起飛的第MM...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.79,0:03:59.14,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.53,0:04:00.98,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡就是機場！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.48,0:04:02.69,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.99,0:04:04.74,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,機場 到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.93,0:04:06.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸！嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.37,0:04:06.78,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.96,0:04:08.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那幾位著裝整齊的人...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.48,0:04:15.76,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是駕駛飛機的飛行員和為空中旅途護航的空服小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.48,0:04:18.16,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.34,0:04:19.15,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.32,0:04:23.05,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,離小白爸爸媽媽的航班抵達 還有一段時間
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.30,0:04:25.47,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我們隨便逛逛吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.65,0:04:26.84,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.53,0:04:28.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an9}{\fs50}用料講究的水果蜜瓜包
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.54,0:04:35.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an9}{\fs50}在本店消費 可以攢積分！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.54,0:04:41.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7}{\fs50}桃空餅乾
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.18,0:04:49.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,機場真好玩啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.67,0:04:51.52,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,機場 喜歡！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.93,0:04:53.96,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主也很喜歡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.15,0:04:55.46,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,接著去哪裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.10,0:04:59.33,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,去少年最期待的地方吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.44,0:04:59.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(988,641)}瞭望台
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.23,0:05:01.62,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你是指...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.12,0:05:12.46,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.64,0:05:14.60,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,灰機！飛了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.08,0:05:18.70,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,機場嘛 還得來看飛機！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.30,0:05:23.39,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！我一直渴望飛上藍天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.90,0:05:26.33,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,學習了航空力學
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.34,0:05:29.82,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,即使現在夢想已經實現了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.39,0:05:34.81,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,飛機依舊是我的嚮往
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.13,0:05:38.40,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.07,0:05:41.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,還真的很不可思議呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.38,0:05:45.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼大的東西 連翅膀都不扇 居然就能飛起來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.15,0:05:49.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學 這到底是怎麼一回事啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.52,0:05:51.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸 這樣的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.89,0:05:53.78,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.95,0:05:55.69,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼 交接棒！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.98,0:05:57.54,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.30,0:05:59.92,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我來說明！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.30,0:06:03.71,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,鳥是通過扇動翅膀 來承接風
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.35,0:06:07.01,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,飛機則是通過噴射引擎等 來加速
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.21,0:06:11.28,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,利用承接到的風力來進行飛行！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.69,0:06:12.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.64,0:06:15.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,噴射醃青菜！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.64,0:06:15.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1000,970)}胡蘿蔔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.54,0:06:17.40,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,飛天蔬菜嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.59,0:06:18.09,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是說！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.26,0:06:19.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.35,0:06:22.78,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,鳥和飛機都是靠翅膀來承接風力進行飛行的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.27,0:06:25.97,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,描述這種力的專用術語
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.25,0:06:27.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,升力！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.54,0:06:30.39,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯！你居然知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.95,0:06:32.85,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.74,0:06:38.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是基礎中的基礎 雖然肉眼看不到風
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.08,0:06:46.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看吧 乘著風飛走了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.06,0:06:49.09,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.58,0:06:52.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,風對飛行是至關重要的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.86,0:06:53.33,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.51,0:06:54.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.57,0:06:57.54,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,莫非你也對飛機很有興趣？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.88,0:06:59.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也挺懂的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.01,0:07:01.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起用望遠鏡看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.10,0:07:03.07,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,好的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.95,0:07:05.64,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是意氣相投？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.96,0:07:08.06,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼 很開心呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.61,0:07:09.64,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.82,0:07:11.33,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空也要看！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.34,0:07:14.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.12,0:07:19.30,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 小空 小空
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.61,0:07:21.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,看的好遠啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.70,0:07:22.60,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,反了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.95,0:07:23.72,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.90,0:07:25.09,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,要從這邊看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.81,0:07:34.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫天野翔子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.85,0:07:38.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔子有著 飛上高空的女孩 這樣一層意思
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.62,0:07:41.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很棒吧 你叫什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.33,0:07:44.32,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我... 啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.49,0:07:45.53,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.05,0:07:49.99,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,夕凪... 夕凪翼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.05,0:07:49.99,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1035,975)}夕無風
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.13,0:07:52.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸 你也有個很棒的名字呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.03,0:07:54.21,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.38,0:07:56.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.32,0:07:58.69,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,夕無風？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.92,0:08:01.80,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,取個全名 在生活中會更方便吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.10,0:08:04.51,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,前一陣 我跟少年一起琢磨出來的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.78,0:08:06.36,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.55,0:08:08.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,很適合阿翼的名字！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.76,0:08:09.73,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,適合！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.66,0:08:14.05,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,翔子真的很喜歡飛機呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.46,0:08:17.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 我的夢想是要像媽媽一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.26,0:08:20.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成為一名飛行員
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.28,0:08:22.77,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.27,0:08:25.65,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,稍 稍微等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.00,0:08:30.55,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,翔子你是說 你的媽媽是飛行員嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.87,0:08:32.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很厲害吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.61,0:08:35.30,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,厲害！太厲害了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.67,0:08:40.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天啊 是我第一次坐媽媽駕駛的飛機的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.64,0:08:41.93,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,欸！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.16,0:08:43.86,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯定很期待吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.13,0:08:44.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.86,0:08:51.10,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 說起來你一個人 沒別的大人了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.54,0:08:57.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 爸爸的話 現在正在辦理登機手續
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.56,0:08:59.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他叫我在旁邊等一下...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.98,0:09:11.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？對了 明明叫我等著的...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.51,0:09:13.42,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,登機手續是在...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.64,0:09:14.86,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,一樓！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.06,0:09:17.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸現在肯定很擔心吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.67,0:09:22.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚... 怎麼辦...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.20,0:09:25.31,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,不要哭 我們一起去找爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.94,0:09:27.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.23,0:09:28.10,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,好的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.94,0:09:30.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能找到爸爸嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.31,0:09:33.29,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！肯定能找到的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.78,0:09:37.31,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,而且爸爸肯定也在找翔子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.51,0:09:38.43,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我估計...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.60,0:09:40.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}（廣播鈴聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.86,0:09:43.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}現在有一則兒童走失通知
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.54,0:09:47.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}天野翔子小妹妹 你爸爸正在找你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.17,0:09:50.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}請至前台 或者詢問就近的...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.04,0:09:50.98,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.86,0:09:53.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.94,0:09:55.85,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我來背你吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.10,0:10:01.14,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,看我用噴射醃青菜的速度 送你到爸爸那裡去！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.07,0:10:03.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.31,0:10:06.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有 不是噴射醃青菜 是噴射引擎...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.09,0:10:09.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸！哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.79,0:10:11.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,前台是在哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.13,0:10:13.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.35,0:10:15.61,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙一起去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.80,0:10:16.98,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,OK！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.52,0:10:25.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 翔子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.02,0:10:25.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7}{\fs50}總服務台
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.97,0:10:27.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你沒事就好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.39,0:10:30.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.26,0:10:34.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我應該在能看到爸爸的地方等著的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.28,0:10:39.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 爸爸也沒有牢牢看著你 對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.47,0:10:40.64,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.28,0:10:45.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常感謝各位
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.31,0:10:51.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愛人... 不 翔子的媽媽是一位民航飛行員
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.90,0:10:54.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,整天開著飛機到處跑
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.59,0:10:57.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什麼時候陪我們
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.72,0:11:02.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她應該也有想媽媽的時候 卻從來沒有表露出來
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.81,0:11:04.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直在為媽媽加油
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.36,0:11:09.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她期待著有一天能跟媽媽一起飛...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.48,0:11:10.59,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我懂的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.19,0:11:16.49,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是因為太期待 就一個人跑到了能夠看到飛機的地方吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.74,0:11:17.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.86,0:11:19.16,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.71,0:11:22.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你們飛行無憂！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.74,0:11:24.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我們該去登機了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.28,0:11:26.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.94,0:11:30.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家！再見！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.72,0:11:32.76,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,一路順風！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.93,0:11:34.63,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,愛愛！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.08,0:11:37.80,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,飛機就是棒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.31,0:11:40.77,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不僅僅是帶著乘客們飛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.22,0:11:43.97,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,還能聯繫起乘坐的人們的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.50,0:11:46.70,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,少年 這話說得好！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.19,0:11:49.80,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 不...不 我隨便說說的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.99,0:11:51.67,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,這話說得好！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.88,0:11:53.17,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,連公主都...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.70,0:11:57.43,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學 我們也該去接你的父母了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.64,0:11:58.49,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.66,0:12:00.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}（廣播鈴聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.10,0:12:03.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}現在有一則兒童走失通知
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.68,0:12:05.10,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,還有別的走失兒童
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.28,0:12:06.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好擔心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.92,0:12:09.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}Precure小妹妹 Precure小妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.59,0:12:10.59,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸!?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.90,0:12:12.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}彌諾彤先生正在找你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.12,0:12:15.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}請至屋頂的展望台
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.57,0:12:18.99,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,彌諾彤 是上次出現的...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.33,0:12:21.39,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,只會令人有討厭的預感
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.73,0:12:23.12,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧 不能放任他不管！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.34,0:12:24.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.55,0:12:30.20,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,來啊 Precure 快點來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.86,0:12:34.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好熱！那個人真不怕熱呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.73,0:12:36.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們快點去室內吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.31,0:12:40.19,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,說不熱 那是假的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.50,0:12:44.29,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,即使吾是一位自負的武人 熱就還是熱啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.85,0:12:48.63,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 吾有這個！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.34,0:12:53.21,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.38,0:12:55.26,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,這風 能用
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.43,0:12:56.41,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,彌諾彤！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.64,0:12:59.54,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,把我們叫到這裡來 想要做什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.86,0:13:01.92,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,做這個！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.28,0:13:05.18,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧！暗塌谷能量！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.82,0:13:15.75,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.59,0:13:20.56,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你們來這裡的目的 是因為畏懼吾
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.84,0:13:24.90,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,想要坐飛機遠走高飛吧 這可不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.58,0:13:40.50,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.68,0:13:41.84,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,這是！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.17,0:13:47.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}（廣播鈴聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.64,0:13:49.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}乘客們 你們好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.88,0:13:53.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}因為突發的強氣流 全部航班將有延遲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.36,0:13:55.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.53,0:13:58.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽的飛機... 不能飛了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.61,0:14:00.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎... 怎麼會的...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.00,0:14:02.95,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哇哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.61,0:14:06.34,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,這下 你們無法逃脫吾的掌心了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.02,0:14:21.66,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,這下 你們無法逃脫吾的掌心了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.36,0:14:25.49,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你胡說什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.68,0:14:28.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我們不會逃 也不會躲！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.66,0:14:31.14,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,他好像是那種自說自話的類型呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.37,0:14:35.76,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,翔子期盼著坐媽媽的飛機的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.14,0:14:38.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學也很期待和父母團聚...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.11,0:14:42.08,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我們上吧！公主去安全的地方！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.37,0:14:43.25,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.37,0:14:43.25,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3}小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
